            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Maria Gandolfo Barnes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Will make again. Very easy and packed with protein! I added diced onion and minced garlic &amp; instead of using 2 cups of water I used reduced sodium chicken broth and deleted the bouillon cubes to help reduce the sodium. Also used 8 frozen chicken tenderloin breast and cooked everything in a dutch-oven on the stovetop on low setting for several hours. Chicken very tender and moist. My kids enjoyed the chili too!",
            "datePublished": "2013-02-03T11:43:56.430Z"
          },
          {
