            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Amanda Moyle Reynolds"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So YUM!!! I didn't have time to slow cook, so I boiled chicken and then chopped, added other ingredients and simmered for 20 minutes. I added cumin and fresh cilantro, and served with a dollop of greek yogurt and corn chips. My husband flipped! Will DEFINITELY be making this one again!",
            "datePublished": "2014-01-26T06:22:00.187Z"
